  - m_Id: 40945817737539588
    m_Localized: Enter a code first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40945817737539589
    m_Localized: We do not recognize that code. Check the spelling and try again
      - nothing was used up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40945817737539590
    m_Localized: You have already redeemed this code. Each code can be used once
      per player.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40945817737539591
    m_Localized: This code has expired and is no longer being accepted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40945817737539592
    m_Localized: You have reached the promo code limit for this account, so no more
      codes can be redeemed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40945817737539593
    m_Localized: We could not reach the rewards server. Your code was NOT used -
      check your connection and try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40945817737539594
    m_Localized: We could not verify your account, so the code was NOT used. Sign
      in, then try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40945817737539595
    m_Localized: Sign in before redeeming a code - rewards are tied to your account.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40945817737539596
    m_Localized: Something went wrong on our end and the code was NOT used. Please
      try again in a moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
